<Mod id="1c60d0cc-ed38-4572-b163-c4014fc3ba87" version="4">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Leadership Reformation</Name>
    <Teaser>GG and GAs are born with custom promotions to granting allied units their promotions.</Teaser>
    <Description>Great Generals and Great Admirals are now born with unique custom promotions granting to their nearby units!

Recommended Community Patch for 100% functionality.

FAQ:

Q: I CAN'T SEE THE UNITPANEL
A: Look in my Lua folder and there are subfolders with UnitPanel that should  be replacing the UnitPanel in the Lua main folder of this mod (Choose one that meets your condition, not all)</Description>
